Chashni Guitar Chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood Hindi movie Bharat sung by Abhijeet Srivastava.

Strumming Pattern: D UDUD

Jubaan hai fiki [F#] shaam se,        Hui na tosey [F#] baat bhi
Bina mein tere [F#] bewazah,        Hua hoon dekho [G#]aaj bhi [F#]

Karoon mein ye [F#] guzarishein,        Mohabbaton ka [F#] mol de
Neendon mein meri [F#] khwab ka,        Zara sa mitha [F#] bol de

Tu ban ja [F#] banja tu meri, tu ban ja,        [F#] banja, banja tu meri
[G#]Tu ban ja ban [F#]ja banja tu [G#]meri

Ishqe de [F#]chasni [B],        O [C#]mitthi mitthi [F#]chasni [B]

<!-- Post Middle -->

Maina man [F#]gunga [A#7]dhup [D#m]dheemi dheemi,        Maina [G#]mangu chand [F#]ni
Mere [B]jeene mein tujh [D#m]se ho,        Ishqe di chas [B]ni [G#]
O mitthi mitthi [D#m]chas [B]ni [C#]

[F#]Mere khyalon mein jo [D#m]tu ho,        To baatein hun mein [G#m]achchi
achchi karta [B] haan..[C#],        Hmm [F#]dekhun subah subah jo [D#m]tujhe
To sara din [B]achcha hai guzarta

Ye [C#]kaisi teri [F#]arzoo,        [D#m]Ye kaisi teri [B]khwahishein [F#]
Tujhise dekho main karoon,        [D#m]Teri hi far [B]mahishein [F#]

[F#]Tu ban ja banja tu meri, [G#]tu ban ja,        ban [F#]ja, banja banja tu [G#]meri
Ishqe de [F#]chasni [B],        O mitthi [C#]mitthi [F#]chasni [B] [F#]
